# Legacy SSH crypto for Cisco IOSv / IOSvL2. Those images only offer SHA1 key
# exchange + MAC, ssh-rsa host keys, and CBC ciphers, all of which modern OpenSSH,
# paramiko and libssh disable by default. This file re-enables them as acceptable
# fallbacks ("+" adds, so modern peers still negotiate modern algorithms first).
#
# The platform points `network_os: ios` connections at this file via libssh
# (ansible_libssh_config_file); see lab/deploy.py:_build_inventory. Keep it in sync
# with the manual ~/.ssh/config entry used for hand SSH to the switches.
Host *
    KexAlgorithms +diffie-hellman-group14-sha1
    HostKeyAlgorithms +ssh-rsa
    PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms +ssh-rsa
    MACs +hmac-sha1
    Ciphers +aes128-cbc,aes192-cbc,aes256-cbc,3des-cbc
